  "view": "The Jio Platforms IPO is on track for October 21, with a $114 billion valuation and a fresh issue of 27 crore shares. Motilal Oswal sees an 18-36% holding-company discount in RIL, leaving room for a re-rating. The shareholder quota adds a separate route for RIL holders. This is a positive catalyst for Jio Platforms.",
