  "view": "Billings grew 12.8% to Rs 822.3 crore, with recruitment up 12.6% and underlying growth near 14-15%. 99acres accelerated to 21.2% growth, but Shiksha fell 27.2% on AI-driven search pressure. The stock dropped 3% on the print. Mixed signals, so neutral.",
