  "view": "Billings grew 12.8% to ₹822.3 crore, but the reported recruitment figure of 12.6% understates the underlying 14-15% once renewal timing is stripped out. 99acres accelerated to 21.2%, with traffic share held. Shiksha fell 27.2% as AI search answers eat its referral traffic, and the company says that pressure stays in the interim.",
