  "view": "Mixed signals for Flipkart: Big Billion Days drives sales with deals like the Mivi One 5G at Rs 11,999, but Flipkart Minutes trails Blinkit in product availability (88.7% vs 94.4%). Former CXOs pressing Walmart over $4 billion in ESOPs adds governance noise. No clear direction today.",
