  "view": "Flipkart's Big Billion Days is live, with early access on October 8 and the main sale opening October 9. The iPhone 17 256GB is listed at Rs 84,999, or Rs 79,999 with an ICICI Bank card, while the LG 55UR7500 4K TV sits at Rs 35,899. Flipkart Minutes also hired Dibyendu Sen as associate director for brand partnerships and monetisation. The news is mostly promotional and personnel, not a shift in the business.",
