  "stance": "neutral",
  "view": "One story today: Tejas and Qualcomm showed 6G ISAC at India Mobile Congress 2026, using Tejas' 5G base station with Qualcomm's Radio Unit and Distributed Unit chipsets. It is a technology demo, not a contract or revenue. No orders, customers or financials were disclosed, so the read is neutral.",
